  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: "What are you talking to me for? Aren\u2019t you supposed to be delivering
        something? Is this why my packages are always late, you guys just walk around
        talking to everyone you see?"
  - sentences:
    - text: "You got a funny shaped head UPS guy\u2026. \u2026. \u2026. OH DID I
        SAY THAT OUT LOUD! I\u2019M SO SORRY!"
  - sentences:
    - text: "Ugh, I can\u2019t bear talking to anyone around here. They all use such
        flowery language."
